// // ============================================================
// //  QuizBD — Complete Prisma Schema
// //  Fixed + Enhanced from user's base schema
// // ============================================================
// //
// //  Key fixes & improvements over the original:
// //  1.  Option can be TEXT or IMAGE (optionType enum + imageUrl)
// //  2.  SeenLog now tracks setNumber so Handshake resets cleanly
// //  3.  ChapterStat enriched with totalAttempts + avgTimeSecs
// //       so AI weak-zone has time-based signals, not just accuracy
// //  4.  QuizAttempt stores per-question detail (QuizAttemptItem)
// //       — needed for AI feedback and admin analytics
// //  5.  FullBookAttempt + MixBookComboAttempt get per-question
// //       items too, so reports are meaningful
// //  6.  WeakZoneAttempt is now a first-class model (was missing)
// //  7.  Leaderboard, Streak, Bookmark, Note, Notification added
// //  8.  DailySnapshot for instant admin dashboard
// //  9.  All hot-path models have @@index
// //  10. Soft-delete (deletedAt) on content tables
// //  11. ContentStatus enum kept from original
// //

